Package: CNORfeeder
Type: Package
Title: Integration of CellNOptR to add missing links
Version: 1.47.2
Author: Federica Eduati [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Attila Gabor <attila.gabor@uni-heidelberg.de>
Description: This package integrates literature-constrained and data-driven methods
   to infer signalling networks from perturbation experiments. It permits to extends a
   given network with links derived from the data via various inference methods and
   uses information on physical interactions of proteins to guide and validate the
   integration of links.
